repository-code: "https://github.com/pfloos/ESQC_2026"
abstract: >-
  Lecture slides and a PhD-level textbook chapter on Hartree-Fock theory,
  basis sets, self-consistent-field algorithms, and molecular integrals,
  prepared for the European Summer School in Quantum Chemistry (ESQC 2026).
  Includes derivations, historical perspectives, and exercises with worked
  solutions. Research and teaching reuse is governed by the repository
  licence and the credited terms for third-party material.
